Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,hey, there will not feel it alive,\Nlook out below, wake up sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high,\Nhail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky, time\Nto journey on, on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves!.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad just at first?.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, feel it's waiting!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling alive!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up sunshine, here we go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very first\Nday, I'd make my name!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed?.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those giant flying fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness, too far away to\Ntell—is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see from in here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, what are those weird fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryugu Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryugu Palace! Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Border Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still not getting anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You think the snail's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no immediate call for alarm,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but it does seem like there are a lot of\Npeople coming in from the Fishman District.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That many wouldn't come at\None time just for shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dangerous people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,History will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All of Fishman Island will\Nbe united under one flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids, mermen, and fishmen\Nmust all come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We must all be of the same mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've tolerated humans long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Land dwellers are inferior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will rule them, or they will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We will erase the mistakes of the\Npast and forge an everlasting legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ho, ho, ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is the anniversary of our\Nengagement, dear Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to get married today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the Sun Pirates and Jinbe\Nhave decided not to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Annoying, but it isn't exactly unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We take down Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We take down Fukaboshi, Ryuboshi,\NMomboshi, then we're done. Mu-hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then his army-hi will fall,\Nassuming they don't surrender first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mu-hi-hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to feast on their first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me what to cut,\Nand then I'll cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We split up, conquer\None area, and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.62,0:05:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't know what hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before this day is done, the Ryugu\Nkingdom will fall, and we will reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can move, try to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems my theory was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a poneglyph hidden here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew can take care of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't miss a chance to uncover\Nthe world's lost history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I enjoyed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought him because I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you are a bloodthirsty butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll turn your blade\Non us next, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, these guys were after our\Nheads and probably yours too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you expect us to serve them tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a lovely\Nway to settle things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I'm sure they would go for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly not them right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,since you knocked them out before\Nwe could learn why they were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Except it doesn't matter what they wanted\Nbecause we stopped them from doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we turn into the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because everyone on our\Ncrew is so irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or just plain violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just look at our\Ncaptain. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late for regrets now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Luffy, I wonder if he\Ncame across the mermaid princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd still quite like to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor little girl. You things,\Nwhat have you done to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why stop crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we tied up your guards but we\Ndidn't lay a finger on your daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy took her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can assure you that's not the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I only saw Luffy and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark leave the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely I would have noticed if they\Nhad a mermaid princess with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew her you would understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She would never sneak out on her own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Also someone would notice if she\Nsimply squam out of the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She takes after me when it comes to size!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter's as big as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I realize it sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hid ShiraHoshi inside Megalo's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and they all left the palace together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't joke at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Straw Hat has a wild reputation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's pretty far\Nout there, even for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy may be a pirate,\Nbut he's not a kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be another culprit out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't talk your way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If my little girl doesn't come back\Nsafe, then I'm keeping your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll be keeping your\Nfriends in jail. No fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're victims here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they finished their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a bunch of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sonny, looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Things got pretty wild back there,\Nbut you can't keep a super ship down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, others weren't so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The tide brings many sunken\Nvessels to this spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like a graveyard for ships\Nthat couldn't reach the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, this is a place\Noverflowing with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the grace of the Sun Tree Eve,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,many colorful fish and\Ncoral make their home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And whales, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen\Nso many in one place before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them are even\Nbigger than the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they're tucked\Naway in deep waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,whales always know where fertile seas lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is a real wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's endlessly fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much I observe,\Nthere's always something new to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the people who live down here\Nthink this place is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All of Fishman Island, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you got\Nwood from the Tree of Atom,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is a fine ship, worthy\Nof its parts. Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom made a ship out of the\Nsame stuff for Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so nothing less will do for my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do the ship coding for\Nyou, and I'll do it with gusto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't heard that one in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I never caught your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Den,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,don't take this the wrong way,\Nbut for being his brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you sure don't look much like Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're a merman,\Nand he was a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Was one of you adopted or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a human-centric way to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hardly blame you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,since family members tend to look\Nso much alike on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It works a bit differently with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We carry genes from our ancestors\Nthat can show up in different ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and this rule applies to\Nboth merfolk and fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if an octopus mermaid gives birth\Nto a shark merman, that's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It just means that she, or the father, has\Nshark mermans somewhere in their lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The bottom line is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing really surprises us, no\Nmatter what way our children turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it doesn't make\Nmuch sense to us when humans
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,discriminate against someone just\Nbecause they look a certain way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See, the way you look doesn't\Nsay a thing about who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Was one of your ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,a robot, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how it works, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're human, so one of\Nyour parents was a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a rhetorical question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have said, I got a\Nletter from Granny Kokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So I heard all about you and iceberg\Nyou and the old bag stay in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is one face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd miss at any rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the whole story\Nthe good and the bad I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that my brother\Ndied the very same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He lived with gusto
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,either way I do appreciate you coming here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to tell me it seems he chose his students.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're flattering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's drop it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I've been meaning to ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a dude sitting\Nall alone over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be the boss, Jinbe. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it a term of endearment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's waiting for someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but he doesn't want to enter the\Nisland because he's a wanted man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But the front gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you scoundrels get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't this convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ready for a fight\Nbut everyone's tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect much from\Nthose pirates we sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're\Nthe ones who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone leaves you a present,\Nyou don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.62,0:13:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They look scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We fought so hard to keep Vandernak in\Nthe way, and now he wants us right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And is that who I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart Jones from the Fishman District?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He once served us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, he was a decorated\Nsoldier in the Royal Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm set in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you setting a trap for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Had an awful lot of visitors today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not like the last batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a cutlassist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You let them into the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.17,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize we wouldn't\Neven be here in the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,first place if your\Nking hadn't invited us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to. They're scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta give our weapons back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the one behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat was innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made her suffer enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All father-in-laws say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll come around by the\Ntime our honeymoon is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This I suspect I'll never\Nbe your father-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where did you take Shirahoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hung one hair on her head,\Nyou're losing your mind, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:15:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I already had her, why would\NI bother breaking in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here and my daughter is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone took my Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not yours and damn\Nright it's a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going nowhere and\Nwe need answers quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pirates you threw at\Nher are here in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That means she must be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Neptune is telling the truth and\Nshe's gone, she couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me, miss. Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One little toss and you can\Ntrack her down anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me love has made you so blind that\Nyou forgot how to use your own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His power? What's that?\NGood idea. You know, Hardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for a muscle head, you're really\Npretty clever when it comes down to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now he's leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.10,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a real bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Coral? Find my princess for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is flying away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been in love for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can tear us apart, princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Except death, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I had a real big fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is funny, but it's\Na bit inappropriate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't have you, then nobody can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to be a\Nbig, beautiful corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sarah Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Flander Deccan is going to\Ncapture my precious Karoo horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you anything you ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go after Deccan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can earn my kingdom's fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can even take my\Nsoldiers' lives if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, King! They can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that beast catch Hirohoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.50,0:17:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweetie is the not-so-little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the pathetic sight, Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But what a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was confident that I\Ncould take the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never thought the loathsome\NStraw Hats would be part of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got the mark of Arlong on his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to warn me\Nthat there was something
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,wicked going on in the Fishman District.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, how could a former soldier\Nof Neptune's army be the ringleader?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you, Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't drum up any shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because I never felt\Npride in the army to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one reason why I joined,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and that was to learn combat skills so\NI could turn this world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple as that. You traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The comforts of your\Nroyal palace have blinded
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you to what's been\Nhappening on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.68,0:18:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a child, as\Nfar back as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen fishmen oppressed\Nby barbaric humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I've heard enough of your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic creatures can't\Neven breathe underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, no matter how many\Nwe kill, they don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong had a fierce determination to\Nsuffocate the arrogance out of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply admired him for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, we will restore his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The new Fishman Pirates\Ncontinue his legacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the reason I\Ncultivated my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to train until I was strong enough\Nto become Arlong's right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I dreamed of standing by his side when he\Nconquered the world from the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I did, until you humans came along\Nand crushed everything he worked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I thought we\Nwere done with Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just let it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, I don't even know who Arlong is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to\Nbe left out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that I bruise easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough chit-chat, we have\Nbusiness, so let's get down to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing that with just his fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to break the palace down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I am so not into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, I need a favor from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that his own strength? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.36,0:21:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't taken a single energy\Nsteroid, not yet, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He just destroyed that pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, the creep's flooding the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I came you for a banquet, not a drowning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, water drops! Hit the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:21:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's it gonna hit the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My guards are innocent men!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you shoot them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.36,0:22:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You deranged cretin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lives are my responsibility! Ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy to snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinnabental fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Risking his luck for lowly pawns!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just poor proof that you don't\Nhave what it takes to be king!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidnap tools!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Heart! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:22:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're chained and unarmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:22:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's brutal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, he's way stronger\Nthan Arlong ever was!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style bird dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, boss, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.36,0:23:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just move out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.10,0:23:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He used his own Gourmet as a shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two, go untie\Nall of the soldiers. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our negotiation with the kingdom\Ncollapsed. We gave them our word.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,to give back all the hostages\Nunharmed we couldn't keep that promise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that's so honest you're right i'm\Non it My foot's in the water i can
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,feel my life draining away help me\Nnami wait where's nami look Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.38,0:24:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammy has gone missing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.04,0:24:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.95,0:24:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing our friends left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,First priority is releasing\Nthese guys, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try to hang in there\Nand keep at it, brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Always riding my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I recommend running now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.86,0:24:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I need you to untie\Nyour other comrades, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't have the energy for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie the others quickly\Nand take up your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.40,0:24:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them do a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the two Tommy and the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.40,0:24:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.84,0:24:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Green Star Rappel Sia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that chapter needed a giant flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Such exotic flora. Breathe deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.06,0:25:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn bunch of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying here. Come on, Zoro. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.64,0:25:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.74,0:25:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and help\Nthose two get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.96,0:25:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.82,0:25:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if that guy's chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.54,0:25:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.46,0:25:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.46,0:25:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay with me, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.10,0:25:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.38,0:25:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You... Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.62,0:25:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit worrying about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.94,0:25:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.96,0:25:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, focus on you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.96,0:25:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with the angry mob?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.74,0:25:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back the mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.60,0:25:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're nothing but\Nobjects to you, humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.80,0:25:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.71,0:25:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.90,0:25:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:25:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The word's gotten around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:25:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.42,0:26:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you kidnapped all those poor\Nmermaids from the beach in the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.56,0:26:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you take them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.72,0:26:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong guys here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, what gives you the idea\Nthat we're the ones behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I will admit...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.96,0:26:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I love mermaids so much I want\Nto keep them all for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, our crew didn't kidnap them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.60,0:26:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He just admitted that he wants them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you jerk shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.30,0:26:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a dying man here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.98,0:26:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew pirates were guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off our island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this bottle is almost full.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.94,0:26:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a waste of good booze!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.78,0:26:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.74,0:26:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Sanji, jumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.26,0:26:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, get your nose under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.14,0:26:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, is that a blowfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know them, Luffy, your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those guys are my crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.26,0:26:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, interesting crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.28,0:27:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, up there, the captain\Nof the Straw Hat crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.46,0:27:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.84,0:27:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave the order to kidnap\Nthe mermaids, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.60,0:27:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let all of the\Npeople down there see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut your mouth, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check\Nthings out on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.14,0:27:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He jumped off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.72,0:27:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachi, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.58,0:27:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did some jerk do this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.78,0:27:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried, but he won't\Nsay for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.60,0:27:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get off the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only thing he'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.98,0:27:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that Straw Hat had\Ntaken over the Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.40,0:27:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.38,0:27:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out to kidnap more of us mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.54,0:27:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He left his men at the palace\Nso he could go out marauding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.16,0:27:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.30,0:28:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kidnap\NPrincess Shirahoshi, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.70,0:28:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.50,0:28:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess is the size of an orca.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.32,0:28:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's the god of the\Nsea's only daughter, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Some lowlife might dream of kidnapping\Nher, but nobody could pull it off. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.76,0:28:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with that blowfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.22,0:28:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.26,0:29:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shira-ho-shiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.26,0:29:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, well, um, you see,\Nuh, good job, you found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.24,0:29:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's healed! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.64,0:29:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the mermaid princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Something going on behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.24,0:29:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you hear,\Nplease don't turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.79,0:29:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.88,0:29:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.96,0:29:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to die, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.22,0:29:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.70,0:29:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.14,0:29:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They kidnapped the Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.96,0:30:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.36,0:30:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.40,0:30:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.50,0:30:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They they really did it.\NThey kidnapped the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.58,0:30:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell? Why'd you get\Nout of the shark, you big baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.64,0:30:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never so sorry Luffy please don't get\Nmad at me I promise it wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster made her cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pure evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.28,0:30:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,More Princess Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.86,0:30:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just say, Princess? Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.68,0:31:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.18,0:31:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight the urge to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I need to know, if I\Nturn around to look behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.48,0:31:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,am I going to see the mermaid princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.02,0:31:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lie, she's behind you, and\Nthat's exactly why you can't turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.18,0:31:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The sight of an average\Nmermaid almost killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.90,0:31:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see the mermaid princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,every last drop of blood in your body\Nwill spray out your nose like a geyser!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.82,0:31:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you'll be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mermaid Princess they\Nsay, even Boa Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.64,0:31:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the most beautiful\Nwoman in the world pales
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in comparison she's the\Nmost gorgeous mermaid
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.92,0:31:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,who ever lived and now she's\Nright behind me No, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.50,0:31:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, don't turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.40,0:32:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I could give up on my dreams and\Ndie a coward at a ripe old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.58,0:32:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather reach for\Nthe stars and die right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.32,0:32:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But you always told me your\Ndream was to find the All-Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.42,0:32:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.00,0:32:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.32,0:32:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I never realized how\Nmeager my imagination is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.38,0:32:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.28,0:32:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She is quite simply
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.76,0:33:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,too beautiful for the mind to comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.88,0:33:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.38,0:33:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected death by arterial\Nnasal spray but this is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.32,0:33:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I even treat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.86,0:33:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.77,0:33:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if his blood donors\Nhave something to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.76,0:33:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy, what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.68,0:33:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.08,0:33:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.62,0:33:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what creeps did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.36,0:33:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you morons doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught them. We actually\Ndid it. We got destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.60,0:33:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,course guys like us hunt sea\Nkings for a living so what are
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.58,0:33:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,a couple of wussy pirates\Ngonna do those pumps are out
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.58,0:33:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,of their league down here\Nthat's what you get for messing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.90,0:34:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,with sea hunters you jerks\Nand here i thought the army
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.72,0:34:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,was our only hope House you\Nguys are fishermen you realize
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.82,0:34:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not fish don't you\Nhey i remember this low life
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.26,0:34:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. You used to be\None of our long's goons, huh
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.70,0:34:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.48,0:34:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.56,0:34:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we turn them over to the Ammo\NKnight so they can cut their heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.44,0:34:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Luffy's not a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.00,0:34:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.46,0:34:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something flying at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.22,0:34:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.76,0:34:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.67,0:34:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're dumb enough to fall\Nfor the oldest trick in the damn book?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.70,0:34:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is something up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.64,0:34:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no... Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,IT'S FANDER DECKIN!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.98,0:34:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I FOUND YOU PRINCESS!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.30,0:34:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.66,0:34:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.90,0:35:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.64,0:35:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he was in cahoots\Nwith these pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.32,0:35:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's turned on his own people!\NRun, princess! We'll handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.12,0:35:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for an answer, Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's either yes, or death!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.22,0:35:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.88,0:35:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly wish to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.44,0:35:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.72,0:35:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.34,0:35:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been throwing weapons at the castle
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.00,0:35:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to kill her for\Nten whole years now,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.12,0:35:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and you actually think\Nshe's gonna marry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.34,0:35:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really twisted, Vanderdecken!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.66,0:35:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess has been forced to live locked\Nup inside a tower for a whole decade,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.94,0:35:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to your sick sense of romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.02,0:35:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you propose monster! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.78,0:35:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.80,0:35:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, I do suspect that it's a yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.54,0:35:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.68,0:35:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.22,0:36:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.74,0:36:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.70,0:36:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.08,0:36:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.30,0:36:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Say yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.54,0:36:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.06,0:36:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just not my type!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.44,0:36:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.54,0:36:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.12,0:36:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your only reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.28,0:36:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who is your type, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.16,0:36:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After you've let me on\Nfor ten whole years!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.36,0:36:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to love me,\NI refuse to let you exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.78,0:36:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead, my darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.34,0:36:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Princess Shirahoshi, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.52,0:36:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we'll fend them off with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.44,0:36:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you move, you big baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.86,0:36:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.44,0:36:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you caused enough trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.50,0:36:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop telling her what to do, you jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.68,0:36:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of Vander\NDecken's lackeys, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.96,0:37:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably want the princess to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.56,0:37:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I can't protect you if you run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.62,0:37:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll stay. No, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.98,0:37:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone, you scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.26,0:37:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You make me sick, pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.58,0:37:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Real sorry about this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.38,0:37:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.78,0:37:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.86,0:37:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.30,0:37:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Poofie!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.90,0:37:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He did that with his hands tied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.72,0:37:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit sticking your butt into my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.66,0:37:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.50,0:37:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who kidnapped\Nher from the tower, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.86,0:37:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure you never throw\Nanything at anyone ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.32,0:38:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hope you can back that up,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.68,0:38:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'm gonna throw you\Nboth into a shallow grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.44,0:38:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You let me go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.20,0:38:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.62,0:38:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.53,0:38:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHH!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.12,0:38:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,KILL MORE!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.90,0:38:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.81,0:38:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.88,0:38:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He just beat VanderDeckan!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.56,0:38:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's still alive,\Nbut now we can catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.00,0:38:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.91,0:39:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We were together!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.72,0:39:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.63,0:39:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he turned to stone a few minutes back, but\Nhe's all smiles now, and he's conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.22,0:39:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.60,0:39:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.72,0:39:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have died and gone to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.66,0:39:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.42,0:39:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.56,0:39:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm pretty sure your\Nactual dream was to find the all-blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.88,0:39:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but please stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.76,0:39:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes it hard for me to\Nconcentrate when you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.26,0:39:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart's racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.86,0:39:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These people don't like\Nus for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.50,0:39:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.98,0:39:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot. Good job. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.06,0:39:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.14,0:39:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you untie him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.80,0:40:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil pirate did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.48,0:40:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He scared her so much\Nshe's brainwashed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.70,0:40:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.44,0:40:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back home in time\Nfor dinner. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.04,0:40:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, shark. Get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.40,0:40:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, you peasants!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.16,0:40:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanasubi
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.50,0:40:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, I think I know that dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.10,0:40:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Sibon to attack the Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He works for Dickens!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's the Great Monk!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.52,0:40:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.43,0:40:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Swat them down like the insects they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.06,0:40:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.54,0:41:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.84,0:41:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,HITNOOOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.20,0:41:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.34,0:41:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn worthless giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.90,0:41:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.10,0:41:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.52,0:41:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To the sea forest! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.80,0:41:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.94,0:41:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That pirate girl and her mermaid friend\Njust escaped from the Yugu Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.72,0:41:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gives their time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.22,0:42:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-chin, should we have left\Nthe others behind like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.86,0:42:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone else tried to come,\Nwe would have been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.72,0:42:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seemed like they were in trouble, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.76,0:42:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.28,0:42:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they always\Nmake it out alive somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.78,0:42:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know they're tough and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.86,0:42:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something scary about Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.96,0:42:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan said he's strong, but more\Nthan that, he's cruel and ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.92,0:42:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.40,0:42:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They've grown stronger by leaps\Nand bounds these past few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.62,0:42:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, can you tell me what this\Nformer warlord, Jinbe, is like? Huh? Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.16,0:42:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.07,0:42:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true he's a pirate, but\Nhe's well-trusted on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.62,0:42:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and they respect him enough\Nthat he can visit the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.26,0:42:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,too. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.30,0:42:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting, especially since\Nhe was a part of Arlong's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.56,0:42:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And now this Heart guy is presenting\Nhimself like the second coming of Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.06,0:42:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And Jinbe made a point to\Nwarn Luffy not to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.20,0:42:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm pretty sure\NI know why that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.74,0:43:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.65,0:43:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He was trying to keep him safe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.10,0:43:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.12,0:43:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,let's keep our fingers crossed that Zoro\Nand the others don't push Heart too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.06,0:43:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.98,0:43:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet this Jinbe guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.42,0:43:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's waiting for Luffy at\Nthe sea forest now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.98,0:43:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a part of this,\Nwhether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.52,0:43:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole kingdom could topple,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.14,0:43:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know anything about the\Nhistory behind Heart and his pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.82,0:43:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Jinbe could help us\Ndecide how to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.56,0:43:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.22,0:43:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, I need to get to the sea forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.58,0:43:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.76,0:43:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.62,0:43:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we swear we'll take care of Heart\Nand the rest of his crew immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.56,0:43:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.56,0:43:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too weak to give\Nyou my full assistance,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.74,0:43:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't let you sacrifice\Nyour lives like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.10,0:44:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall surrender the palace for the\Ntime being, and meet up with Fukaboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.74,0:44:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight back when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.16,0:44:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean that, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.92,0:44:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let the palace\Nfall to this evil scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.66,0:44:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, but do you really\Nthink you can beat a fish man in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.26,0:44:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak. Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.50,0:44:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know these old bones aren't the\Npriority, but I fear I may soon drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.24,0:44:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to drown\Nwhen you don't have lungs?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.48,0:44:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.36,0:44:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
